 Stage 3 of the safari intake drives the donated chapters through our wasm
 road. It must CALL into the port and not merely cite it: citing is enough
 to type-check a chapter but not to emit it, and a driver that only cited
 produced a WAT of 108 foreword runtime functions and none of Steve's, which
 reads exactly like a clean pass.

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   let w = build-world
   in let r = ride-initial
   in let r2 = ride-step w r
   in let cmds = ride-frame w r2
   in print-line-uni ("safari segments: " & integer-to-text (list-length w))
   print-line-uni ("safari draw commands: " & integer-to-text (list-length cmds))
  end
